{"title": "Light (weapon property)", "pageid": 610, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Light_(weapon_property)", "categories": ["Weapon Property"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Light_Weapon.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Light_Weapon.jpg/300px-Light_Weapon.jpg.webp, /w/images/a/a5/Light_Weapon.jpg 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Light_Weapon.jpg/300px-Light_Weapon.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"95\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a5/Light_Weapon.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>In-game tooltip</figcaption></figure>\n<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">For an explanation of all weapon properties, see <a href=\"/wiki/Weapons\" title=\"Weapons\">Weapons</a>. For the cantrip, see <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Light\" title=\"Light\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/Light_Icon.webp/25px-Light_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5c/Light_Icon.webp/38px-Light_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5c/Light_Icon.webp/50px-Light_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Light\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/Light_Icon.webp/25px-Light_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5c/Light_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Light\" title=\"Light\">Light</a>.</div>\n<p><b>Light</b> is a weapon property that allows characters to dual wield weapons, that is, equip one Light weapon in their main hand and one Light weapon in their off-hand.\n</p><p>When dual wielding, after taking the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Main_Hand_Attack\" title=\"Main Hand Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp/30px-Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Main Hand Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Hand_Attack\" title=\"Main Hand Attack\">Main Hand Attack</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ranged_Attack\" title=\"Ranged Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Ranged_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Ranged_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Ranged_Attack_Icon.webp/30px-Ranged_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Ranged_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Ranged_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ranged Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Ranged_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Ranged_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c3/Ranged_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ranged_Attack\" title=\"Ranged Attack\">Ranged Attack</a> actions, a <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> can be used to make an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Off-Hand_Attack_(Melee)\" title=\"Off-Hand Attack (Melee)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Off-Hand_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Off-Hand_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Off-Hand_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/30px-Off-Hand_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Off-Hand_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Off-Hand_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Off-Hand Attack (Melee)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Off-Hand_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Off-Hand_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Off-Hand_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Off-Hand_Attack_(Melee)\" title=\"Off-Hand Attack (Melee)\">Off-Hand Attack (Melee)</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Off-Hand_Attack_(Ranged)\" title=\"Off-Hand Attack (Ranged)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Off-Hand_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp/20px-Off-Hand_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Off-Hand_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp/30px-Off-Hand_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Off-Hand_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp/40px-Off-Hand_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Off-Hand Attack (Ranged)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Off-Hand_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp/20px-Off-Hand_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Off-Hand_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Off-Hand_Attack_(Ranged)\" title=\"Off-Hand Attack (Ranged)\">Off-Hand Attack (Ranged)</a>. The <i>Dual Wielding</i> toggle on the hotbar controls whether these attacks are made together or separately.\n</p><p>By default, no <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_score_modifier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability score modifier\">ability score modifier</a> is added to the damage of an Off-Hand Attack.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_Light_Weapons\">List of Light Weapons</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Clubs\" title=\"Clubs\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Clubs_Icon.png/25px-Clubs_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Clubs_Icon.png/38px-Clubs_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Clubs_Icon.png/50px-Clubs_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Clubs\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Clubs_Icon.png/25px-Clubs_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Clubs_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Clubs\" title=\"Clubs\">Clubs</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Daggers\" title=\"Daggers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Daggers_Icon.png/25px-Daggers_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b8/Daggers_Icon.png/38px-Daggers_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b8/Daggers_Icon.png/50px-Daggers_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Daggers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Daggers_Icon.png/25px-Daggers_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b8/Daggers_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Daggers\" title=\"Daggers\">Daggers</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Handaxes\" title=\"Handaxes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Handaxes_Icon.png/25px-Handaxes_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/Handaxes_Icon.png/38px-Handaxes_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/Handaxes_Icon.png/50px-Handaxes_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Handaxes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Handaxes_Icon.png/25px-Handaxes_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fb/Handaxes_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Handaxes\" title=\"Handaxes\">Handaxes</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hand_Crossbows\" title=\"Hand Crossbows\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Hand_Crossbows_Icon.png/25px-Hand_Crossbows_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Hand_Crossbows_Icon.png/38px-Hand_Crossbows_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Hand_Crossbows_Icon.png/50px-Hand_Crossbows_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hand Crossbows\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Hand_Crossbows_Icon.png/25px-Hand_Crossbows_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Hand_Crossbows_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hand_Crossbows\" title=\"Hand Crossbows\">Hand Crossbows</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Light_Hammers\" title=\"Light Hammers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Light_Hammers_Icon.png/25px-Light_Hammers_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Light_Hammers_Icon.png/38px-Light_Hammers_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Light_Hammers_Icon.png/50px-Light_Hammers_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Light Hammers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Light_Hammers_Icon.png/25px-Light_Hammers_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Light_Hammers_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Light_Hammers\" title=\"Light Hammers\">Light Hammers</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scimitars\" title=\"Scimitars\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Scimitars_Icon.png/25px-Scimitars_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Scimitars_Icon.png/38px-Scimitars_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Scimitars_Icon.png/50px-Scimitars_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Scimitars\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Scimitars_Icon.png/25px-Scimitars_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Scimitars_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scimitars\" title=\"Scimitars\">Scimitars</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shortswords\" title=\"Shortswords\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Shortswords_Icon.png/25px-Shortswords_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Shortswords_Icon.png/38px-Shortswords_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Shortswords_Icon.png/50px-Shortswords_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shortswords\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Shortswords_Icon.png/25px-Shortswords_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Shortswords_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shortswords\" title=\"Shortswords\">Shortswords</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sickles\" title=\"Sickles\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Sickles_Icon.png/25px-Sickles_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Sickles_Icon.png/38px-Sickles_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Sickles_Icon.png/50px-Sickles_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sickles\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Sickles_Icon.png/25px-Sickles_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Sickles_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sickles\" title=\"Sickles\">Sickles</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Two-Weapon_Fighting\" title=\"Two-Weapon Fighting\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp/25px-Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp/38px-Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp/50px-Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Two-Weapon Fighting\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp/25px-Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Two-Weapon_Fighting\" title=\"Two-Weapon Fighting\">Two-Weapon Fighting</a> fighting style allows a character to add their ability score modifier to the damage of an Off-Hand Attack as though it were a Main Hand Attack.</li>\n<li>The <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dual_Wielder\" title=\"Dual Wielder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Dual_Wielder_Icon.webp/25px-Dual_Wielder_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Dual_Wielder_Icon.webp/38px-Dual_Wielder_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Dual_Wielder_Icon.webp/50px-Dual_Wielder_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dual Wielder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Dual_Wielder_Icon.webp/25px-Dual_Wielder_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0f/Dual_Wielder_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dual_Wielder\" title=\"Dual Wielder\">Dual Wielder</a> feat allows a character to dual wield any non-Two-Handed weapons, even if they are not Light.</li>\n<li>When the <i>Dual Wielding</i> toggle is enabled, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/30px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Opportunity Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\">Opportunity Attacks</a> are made with both weapons, each attack being made separately.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195020\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.057 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.060 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3324/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20415/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4060/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1268295/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.421      1 -total\n 71.55%   31.070     16 Template:Icon_link\n 68.70%   29.831     16 Template:Icon_text\n 54.67%   23.739     32 Template:Trim\n 28.19%   12.242     16 Template:Ifempty\n 26.65%   11.574      8 Template:WeaponType\n 25.77%   11.189      5 Template:SmSAI\n 22.19%    9.633      1 Template:Hatnote\n 21.46%    9.320      1 Template:SAI\n 14.99%    6.511     16 Template:Icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:610-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195020 and revision id 390050. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}